# CI Probe Strategy Guide

A throwaway strategy that the generator's end-to-end test adds to a temporary copy of the repository. It returns
the ticker it was asked about and nothing else.

Its conventions are described in [Financial Math & Data Conventions](../FINANCE_MATH.md#shared-data-conventions) and
its terms in the [glossary](../GLOSSARY.md).

```bash
uv run ian ci-probe AAPL
```

## Watchlist options

`watchlist create --analysis ci-probe` and `watchlist add-selection --analysis ci-probe` accept `--as-of` and
`--no-cache`. See [Local Research Workspace](../WORKSPACE.md#strategies-and-their-watchlist-options) for the
watchlist commands that take them.
